Dungeon Crawl Stone Soup runs on the tildeverse, at
https://crawl.tildeverse.org. In the terminal:

  curl -so ~/.ssh/dcss https://crawl.tildeverse.org/dcss.key
  chmod 600 ~/.ssh/dcss
  ssh -i ~/.ssh/dcss dcss@crawl.tildeverse.org
